  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "q1",
      "number": 1,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following prefix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`+ / * 5 2 - 7 2 6`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一个单独的数值,计算下方前缀表达式的值:\n\n`+ / * 5 2 - 7 2 6`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "11",
            "zh": "11"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "8",
            "zh": "8"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "6",
            "zh": "6"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "5",
            "zh": "5"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "2",
            "zh": "2"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nTo evaluate the prefix expression, group every operator followed by 2 operands or digits at the beginning. Then translate the expression to infix and evaluate from the inside out:\n\n`+ / * 5 2 - 7 2 6`\n\n= (+ (/ (* 5 2) ( - 7 2)) 6) = (+ (/ 10 5) 6) = (+ 2 6) = 8",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n最外层是加法，第二个操作数是 6。第一个操作数是除法，它的左右子式分别为 $5\\times2=10$ 和 $7-2=5$。所以结果是 $10/5+6=8$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
