    {
      "id": "q2",
      "number": 2,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Evaluate the following postfix expression if all numbers are single digits:\n\n`9 3 - 5 2 + * 2 3 ^ 3 2 ^ + -`",
        "zh": "如果下方所有数字都是一个单独的数值,计算下方后缀表达式的值\n\n`9 3 - 5 2 + * 2 3 ^ 3 2 ^ + -`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "46",
            "zh": "46"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "42",
            "zh": "42"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "41",
            "zh": "41"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "25",
            "zh": "25"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "24",
            "zh": "24"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "D"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **D**.\n\nTo evaluate the postfix expression, group every operator preceded by 2 operands or digits at the beginning. Then translate the expression to infix and evaluate from the inside out:\n\n`9 3 - 5 2 + * 2 3 ^ 3 2 ^ + -`\n\n= (((9 3 - ) (5 2 +) *) ((2 3 ^) (3 2 ^) +) - ) = ((6 7 *) (8 9 +) - ) = (42 17 - ) = 25",
        "zh": "答案：**D**。\n\n后缀式从左到右归并，遇到减号时先弹出的是右操作数。左半段得到 $(9-3)(5+2)=6\\times7=42$，右半段得到 $2^3+3^2=8+9=17$。最后算 $42-17=25$。"
      },
      "source": {
        "statementSource": "statement",
        "statementPages": [
          1,
          2
        ],
        "solutionSource": "solution",
        "solutionPages": [
          1
        ],
        "answerProvenance": "official"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "q3",
      "number": 3,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to prefix:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4*(7-5)}{(8-2)/(2+1)}\n$$",
        "zh": "请将下方的中缀表达式转换为前缀表达式:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4*(7-5)}{(8-2)/(2+1)}\n$$"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`* / 4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 1 2`",
            "zh": "`* / 4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 1 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ * 4 - 5 7 / - 2 8 + 1 2`",
            "zh": "`/ * 4 - 5 7 / - 2 8 + 1 2`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 2 1 * /`",
            "zh": "`4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 2 1 * /`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ * - 7 5 4 / - 8 2 + 2 1`",
            "zh": "`/ * - 7 5 4 / - 8 2 + 2 1`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`/ * 4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 2 1`",
            "zh": "`/ * 4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 2 1`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "E"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **E**.\n\nTo convert the following infix expression to prefix, use the order of operations (PEMDAS)and write each infix expression with the operator before both operands in the same order:\n\n$$\n\\frac{4*(7-5)}{(8-2)/(2+1)}\n$$\n\n= (4 * ( - 7 5)) / (( - 8 2) / (+ 2 1)) = (* 4 - 7 5) / (/ - 8 2 + 2 1) = / * 4 - 7 5 / - 8 2 + 2 1",
        "zh": "答案：**E**。\n\n先分别写分子和分母。分子 $4(7-5)$ 的前缀是 `* 4 - 7 5`，分母 $(8-2)/(2+1)$ 的前缀是 `/ - 8 2 + 2 1`。外层仍是除法，在两段之前再放一个除号。"
      },
      "source": {
