    {
      "id": "q4",
      "number": 4,
      "type": "single",
      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following infix expression to postfix:\n\n5 * 7 - (1 + 4) * 6 + 2",
        "zh": "请将下方的中缀表达式转换为后缀表达式:\n\n5 * 7 - (1 + 4) * 6 + 2"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 * - 2 +`",
            "zh": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 * - 2 +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 7 * 1 4 + - 6 * 2 +`",
            "zh": "`5 7 * 1 4 + - 6 * 2 +`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 2 + * -`",
            "zh": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 2 + * -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 2 * + -`",
            "zh": "`5 7 * 1 4 + 6 2 * + -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`7 5 * 4 1 + 6 * + 2 -`",
            "zh": "`7 5 * 4 1 + 6 * + 2 -`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "A"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **A**.\n\nTo convert the following infix expression to postfix, use the order of operations (PEMDAS)and write each infix expression with the operator after both operands in the same order:\n\n5 * 7 - (1 + 4) * 6 + 2 = ((5 7 *) - ((1 4 +) * 6)) + 2 = ((5 7 *) - ((1 4 +) 6 *)) + 2 = ((5 7 *) ((1 4 +) 6 *) - ) + 2\n\n`= ((5 7 *) ((1 4 +) 6 *) - ) 2 +`\n\n`= 5 7 * 1 4 + 6 * - 2 +`",
        "zh": "答案：**A**。\n\n乘积分别转成 `5 7 *` 和 `1 4 + 6 *`。原式同级的减法在加 2 之前，所以先把两个乘积接上减号，再接 `2 +`。完整后缀为 `5 7 * 1 4 + 6 * - 2 +`。"
      },
