      "topic": {
        "en": "Prefix/Infix/Postfix Notation",
        "zh": "前缀／中缀／后缀表达式"
      },
      "statement": {
        "en": "Convert the following expression from prefix to postfix:\n\n`- / * ^ 5 2 4 2 + 1 9`",
        "zh": "请将下方的前缀表达式转换为后缀表达式:\n\n`- / * ^ 5 2 4 2 + 1 9`"
      },
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 2 ^ 4 2 * / 1 9 + -`",
            "zh": "`5 2 ^ 4 2 * / 1 9 + -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 2 ^ 4 * 2 / 1 9 + -`",
            "zh": "`5 2 ^ 4 * 2 / 1 9 + -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 2 ^ 2 4 * / 9 1 + -`",
            "zh": "`5 2 ^ 2 4 * / 9 1 + -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 2 ^ 4 2 1 9 * / + -`",
            "zh": "`5 2 ^ 4 2 1 9 * / + -`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "E",
          "text": {
            "en": "`5 2 ^ 4 * 2 / 1 9 - +`",
            "zh": "`5 2 ^ 4 * 2 / 1 9 - +`"
          }
        }
      ],
      "correctOptionIds": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": {
        "en": "Answer: **B**.\n\nTo convert the following expression from prefix to postfix, change each group of 2 operands preceded by an operator to a group of 2 operands succeeded by an operator::\n\n`- / * ^ 5 2 4 2 + 1 9`\n\n= - / * (5 2 ^) 4 2 (1 9 +) = - / ((5 2 ^) 4 *) 2 (1 9 +) = - (((5 2 ^) 4 *) 2 /) (1 9 +)\n\n`= 5 2 ^ 4 * 2 / 1 9 + -`",
        "zh": "答案：**B**。\n\n前缀式最外层是减法。左侧先算 $5^2$，再乘 4 除以 2，转换为 `5 2 ^ 4 * 2 /`；右侧 $1+9$ 转成 `1 9 +`。后缀的减号写在两段之后。"
      },
